  "about": {
  "title": "About me",

  "paragraphs": [
    "My mission is to combine many years of clinical experience with modern plastic surgery techniques in order to ensure patient safety, natural results, and the highest standard of medical care.",

    "I am a graduate of the Faculty of Medicine at the Medical University of Łódź. I hold the first-degree specialization in general surgery and the title of specialist in plastic surgery, obtained after passing the National Specialization Examination with excellent results.",

    "Since 1994, I have been associated with the Clinical Department of Plastic, Reconstructive and Aesthetic Surgery at the University Teaching Hospital No. 1 in Łódź, where I have held the position of Deputy Head of Department for many years. In parallel, I consult and perform plastic surgery procedures in reputable private clinics.",

    "I have over 30 years of experience in plastic and reconstructive surgery, covering the full spectrum of aesthetic and reconstructive procedures of the face, breast, and body. I have continuously developed my skills through numerous courses, trainings, and scientific conferences in Poland and abroad.",

    "I hold a PhD in medical sciences, awarded on the basis of an outstanding doctoral dissertation entitled “Evaluation of long-term results of surgical treatment of congenital nasal deformities. Clinical and anthropometric studies.”",

    "I am the author and co-author of scientific publications in national and international medical journals, and an active member of the Polish Society of Plastic, Reconstructive and Aesthetic Surgery, regularly participating in scientific congresses and conferences.",

    "Plastic surgery is not only my profession but also a lifelong passion and responsibility towards my patients, allowing me to continuously improve my skills and maintain the highest standards of treatment."
  ],

